Weather
- Elevation: approx. 2,000–13,000 ft (600–4,000 m)
- Precipitation: ~95% falls Oct–May; >75% Nov–Mar
- Snow: Most of the park snow-covered Nov–May; Yosemite Valley can be rainy or snowy during winter storms

Directions
- Year-round vehicle access from the west via Highways 41, 140, and 120
- Tioga Pass Entrance (Highway 120 from the east): typically closed approx. Nov through late May or June
