- Park: Open 24 hours/day, 365 days/year
- Hetch Hetchy: Open sunrise–sunset for day use; all day visitors must exit by sunset. Road closed to all vehicles from sunset to sunrise. Permitted backpackers may stay overnight but cannot drive when the road is closed.

