Endpoint: GET /v1/payment_intents
- Description: Returns a list of PaymentIntents.
- operationId: GetPaymentIntents

Query parameters
- created (optional, deepObject style):
  - Filter on the object’s created field.
  - Accepts either:
    - Integer Unix timestamp, or
    - Object with any of: gt, gte, lt, lte (integers).
- customer (optional, string, max 5000):
  - Only return PaymentIntents for the specified customer ID.
- ending_before (optional, string, max 5000):
  - Pagination cursor for fetching the previous page. Use an object ID that appears at the start of the current page.
- expand (optional, array of strings, deepObject style):
  - Specifies which fields in the response should be expanded.
- limit (optional, integer):
  - Number of objects to return. Range 1–100; default 10.
- starting_after (optional, string, max 5000):
  - Pagination cursor for fetching the next page. Use an object ID that appears at the end of the current page.

Request body
- Content type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
- Optional; schema is an empty object (no defined properties).

Response: 200 OK
- Content type: application/json
- Schema properties:
  - data: array of PaymentIntent objects

PaymentIntent object (as returned in this list)
- Description:
  - Guides collection of a payment from a customer.
  - Typically create exactly one per order/session; references history of payment attempts.
  - Transitions through multiple statuses as it performs authentication and may create at most one successful charge.
  - Related guide: https://stripe.com/docs/payments/payment-intents

Key fields (subset presented in content)
- amount (integer):
  - Intended amount to collect in the smallest currency unit.
  - Minimum $0.50 USD (or equivalent).
  - Supports up to eight digits (e.g., 99999999 for $999,999.99 USD).
- amount_capturable (integer):
  - Amount that can currently be captured.
- amount_received (integer):
  - Amount collected.
- application (nullable):
  - Either a string ID of the Connect application that created the PaymentIntent, or an expanded Application object:
    - Application: { id (string), name (string, nullable), object = "application" }
- application_fee_amount:
  - Amount of any application fee requested to be applied to the payment and transferred to the application owner’s Stripe account; capped at the total amount captured.

amount_details (one of)
1) PaymentFlowsAmountDetails:
   - discount_amount (integer > 0):
     - Total discount applied to the transaction in the smallest currency unit.
     - Mutually exclusive with amount_details[line_items][#][discount_amount].
   - line_items (list; max 100 items):
     - List object with:
       - data: array of line item objects (required fields: id, object, product_name, quantity, unit_cost)
       - has_more (boolean)
       - object = "list"
       - url (string)
     - Line item object fields:
